# Netlify Routing Rules for Kineflex Player & Streaming API

# 1. Typo correction: redirect /move/* to /movie/*
/move/*     /movie/:splat                   301!

# 2. Serverless API routes -> Handled server-side by Netlify Function (keeps client from calling upstream directly)
/api/*      /.netlify/functions/api/:splat  200
/v1/*       /.netlify/functions/api/:splat  200
/health     /.netlify/functions/api/health  200
/version    /.netlify/functions/api/version 200

# 3. HTML Video Player Rewrites (HTTP 200 keeps URL clean in browser)
/movie/*    /player.html                    200
/tv/*       /player.html                    200
/play=*     /player.html                    200
